{"id":"m3nqgpxmtf74mkp91r21oiqy7","title":"债券如何运作：你需要了解的一切","originalTitle":"How Bonds Work: Everything You Need To Know","summary":"自1871年以来，10年期国债收益率与随后十年的债券回报率有0.95的相关性，且无名义亏损期。债券能降低投资组合波动性，自1926年起，60/40组合捕获了约81%的股市回报，但仅吸收了约62%的波动性。高且上升的通胀是债券的最大敌人，导致平均真实回报率为-10.9%。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha"},"links":{"original":"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4965896-how-bonds-work-everything-you-need-to-know?source=feed_all_articles"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T17:30:00.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-10T17:39:19.960Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-10T17:39:19.960Z","category":"macro","tags":["研究报告"],"score":27,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"c4b478c7-cd96-43e5-8a42-8d7044da1e53","title":"长期国债收益率与债券回报率的历史关联性分析"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"c4b478c7-cd96-43e5-8a42-8d7044da1e53","title":"长期国债收益率与债券回报率的历史关联性分析"}],"topics":[{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fp3cr7wxdTvk","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}